      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying a heavy burden of self-criticism right now, and those feelings can feel incredibly isolating. Please know that these intense moods do not define your worth or the love you share with your partner. Reaching out is a significant first step; consider speaking with a therapist who can help you gently explore these feelings and develop healthier coping strategies. You are not a drain, but you are deserving of support as you navigate this difficult time.",
