      "content": "i dont think \"taking small steps\" is gonna fix this. it's like i'm a weight around their necks. if i just wasn't here, they wouldn't have to spend their whole life managing my depression. it almost feels like the most selfless thing i could do is just... get out of the way so they can finally have a real life. doesnt that make sense?",
